Package: bchR
Title: Access to the Banco Central de Honduras Web API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Henry", "Osorto", email = "henry.osorto@unah.edu.hn",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4334-9179")))
Description: Provides a reproducible R interface to the Web API of the Banco
        Central de Honduras (BCH). Supports secure management of API keys,
        retrieval and interactive browsing of the indicator catalogue, and
        retrieval of individual indicator series with minimal documented type
        conversion and secret-free provenance metadata.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    askpass,
    base64enc,
    htmltools,
    httr2 (>= 1.2.0),
    reactable
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.1.0)
